1. Download the Q6_JenkinsBuildJob folder from ma'am's Drive (Download all), extract it to C:\
(so the path is C:\Q6_JenkinsBuildJob) and open it in VS Code (File > Open Folder).

2. In Drive, build-info is a Google Doc - open it, copy the text and save it in VS Code as build-
info.txt. Then delete the downloaded .docx copies (build-info, README, scripts\build.bat) from the

folder.
3. Create scripts\build.bat in VS Code and paste (the Drive copy is a Google Doc with TODOs):
