4. Open http://localhost:8080 and log in to Jenkins.
SCREENSHOT 1: Browser - Jenkins home page (localhost:8080)
5. New Item > name Jenkins_Freestyle_Build > Freestyle project > OK.
6. Under General click Advanced > tick Use custom workspace > Directory:
C:\Q6_JenkinsBuildJob
SCREENSHOT 2: Browser - Jenkins job Configure page (General section with custom workspace)
7. Build Steps > Add build step > Execute Windows batch command > paste:
call scripts\build.bat
